    @* ╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
       ║  OFFLINE-FIRST: vendored copies of Bootstrap CSS, Bootstrap Icons, ║
       ║  and JetBrains Mono live under Kmila.Shared/wwwroot/lib/. Mirror   ║
       ║  any change here in Kmila/wwwroot/index.html. CDN refs were        ║
       ║  removed so the Android target works without the network.         ║
       ╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝ *@
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="_content/Kmila.Shared/lib/jetbrains-mono/jetbrains-mono.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="_content/Kmila.Shared/lib/bootstrap/bootstrap.min.css">
